# WarFictionSim C++ 代码风格（宪法：规范代码风格，CI 以 clang-format --dry-run --Werror 强制）
# 基线：Google 风格 + 项目定制（C++20、4 空格缩进、120 列、左指针）
BasedOnStyle: Google
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++20
IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 120
PointerAlignment: Left
DerivePointerAlignment: false
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
